      "title": "Pop Song Craft: Hooks, Verse-Chorus, and Production",
      "level": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "**Track:** styles | **Difficulty:** 3/10 | **Time:** ~10 min"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Popular song favours memorable hooks, verse–chorus form, and repeating four-chord loops."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "chord-loops",
      "title": "Chord loops",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "I–V–vi–IV and rotations (vi–IV–I–V) underpin countless hits. Folk singers borrow pop craft for originals and trad arrangements."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "production",
      "title": "Production",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Verse stripped to guitar-vocal; chorus adds bodhrán and fiddle. Dynamic build into final chorus. Pacing for festival slots."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "form",
      "title": "Form",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Verse narrates; chorus repeats hook. Bridge provides contrast before final chorus."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
